    "filename": "Joseph Mallord William Turner - Raby Castle, the Seat of the Earl of Darlington - Walters 3741.jpg",
    "title": "File:Joseph Mallord William Turner - Raby Castle, the Seat of the Earl of Darlington - Walters 3741.jpg",
    "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/Joseph_Mallord_William_Turner_-_Raby_Castle%2C_the_Seat_of_the_Earl_of_Darlington_-_Walters_3741.jpg",
    "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Joseph_Mallord_William_Turner_-_Raby_Castle,_the_Seat_of_the_Earl_of_Darlington_-_Walters_3741.jpg",
